\"The process consists of two parts: generating the mnemonic and converting it into a binary seed.\", \"line\": 6, \"span\": \"It consists of two parts: generating the mnemonic and converting it into a binary seed.\"}, {\"text\": \"The seed can be later used to generate deterministic wallets using BIP-0032 or similar methods.\", \"line\": 6, \"span\": \"This seed can be later used to generate deterministic wallets using BIP-0032 or similar methods.\"}, {\"text\": \"This BIP is licensed under the BSD 2-clause license.\", \"line\": 9, \"span\": \"This BIP is licensed under the BSD 2-clause license.\"}, {\"text\": \"The sentence could be written on paper.\", \"line\": 12, \"span\": \"The sentence could be written on paper or spoken over the telephone.\"}, {\"text\": \"The sentence could be spoken over the telephone.\", \"line\": 12, \"span\": \"The sentence could be written on paper or spoken over the telephone.\"}, {\"text\": \"This guide is meant to be a way to transport computer-generated determinism with a human-readable transcription.\", \"line\": 14, \"span\": \"This guide is meant to be a way to transport computer-generated determinism with a human-readable transcription.\"}, {\"text\": \"This guide is not a way to process user-created sentences into a wallet seed.\", \"line\": 14, \"span\": \"It's not a way to process user-created sentences (also known as brainwallets) into a wallet seed.\"}, {\"text\": \"User-created sentences are also known as brainwallets.\", \"line\": 14, \"span\": \"also known as brainwallets\"}, {\"text\": \"The mnemonic must encode entropy in a multiple of 32 bits.\", \"line\": 17, \"span\": \"The mnemonic must encode entropy in a multiple of 32 bits.\"}, {\"text\": \"The initial entropy length is referred to as ENT.\", \"line\": 17, \"span\": \"We refer to the initial entropy length as ENT.\"}, {\"text\": \"The allowed size of ENT is 128-256 bits.\", \"line\": 17, \"span\": \"The allowed size of ENT is 128-256 bits.\"}, {\"text\": \"An initial entropy of ENT bits is generated first.\", \"line\": 19, \"span\": \"First, an initial entropy of ENT bits is generated.\"}, {\"text\": \"A checksum is generated by taking the first ENT / 32 bits of the SHA256 hash of the initial entropy.\", \"line\": 19, \"span\": \"A checksum is generated by taking the first ENT / 32 bits of its SHA256 hash.\"}, {\"text\": \"The checksum is appended to the end of the initial entropy.\", \"line\": 19, \"span\": \"This checksum is appended to the end of the initial entropy.\"}, {\"text\": \"The concatenated bits are split into groups of 11 bits.\", \"line\": 19, \"span\": \"Next, these concatenated bits are split into groups of 11 bits, each encoding a number from 0-2047, serving as an index into a wordlist.\"}, {\"text\": \"Each group of 11 bits encodes a number from 0-2047.\", \"line\": 19, \"span\": \"each encoding a number from 0-2047, serving as an index into a wordlist\"}, {\"text\": \"Each number from 0-2047 serves as an index into a wordlist.\", \"line\": 19, \"span\": \"serving as an index into a wordlist\"}, {\"text\": \"The numbers are converted into words and the joined words are used as a mnemonic sentence.\", \"line\": 19, \"span\": \"Finally, we convert these numbers into words and use the joined words as a mnemonic sentence.\"}, {\"text\": \"CS equals ENT / 32.\", \"line\": 24, \"span\": \"CS = ENT / 32\"}, {\"text\": \"MS equals (ENT + CS) / 11.\", \"line\": 25, \"span\": \"MS = (ENT + CS) / 11\"}, {\"text\": \"When ENT is 128, CS is 4.\", \"line\": 29, \"span\": \"|  128  |  4 |   132  |  12  |\"}, {\"text\": \"When ENT is 128, ENT+CS is 132.\", \"line\": 29, \"span\": \"|  128  |  4 |   132  |  12  |\"}, {\"text\": \"When ENT is 128, MS is 12.\", \"line\": 29, \"span\": \"|  128  |  4 |   132  |  12  |\"}, {\"text\": \"When ENT is 160, CS is 5.\", \"line\": 30, \"span\": \"|  160  |  5 |   165  |  15  |\"}, {\"text\": \"When ENT is 160, ENT+CS is 165.\", \"line\": 30, \"span\": \"|  160  |  5 |   165  |  15  |\"}, {\"text\": \"When ENT is 160, MS is 15.\", \"line\": 30, \"span\": \"|  160  |  5 |   165  |  15  |\"}, {\"text\": \"When ENT is 192, CS is 6.\", \"line\": 31, \"span\": \"|  192  |  6 |   198  |  18  |\"}, {\"text\": \"When ENT is 192, ENT+CS is 198.\", \"line\": 31, \"span\": \"|  192  |  6 |   198  |  18  |\"}, {\"text\": \"When ENT is 192, MS is 18.\", \"line\": 31, \"span\": \"|  192  |  6 |   198  |  18  |\"}, {\"text\": \"When ENT is 224, CS is 7.\", \"line\": 32, \"span\": \"|  224  |  7 |   231  |  21  |\"}, {\"text\": \"When ENT is 224, ENT+CS is 231.\", \"line\": 32, \"span\": \"|  224  |  7 |   231  |  21  |\"}, {\"text\": \"When ENT is 224, MS is 21.\", \"line\": 32, \"span\": \"|  224  |  7 |   231  |  21  |\"}, {\"text\": \"When ENT is 256, CS is 8.\", \"line\": 33, \"span\": \"|  256  |  8 |   264  |  24  |\"}, {\"text\": \"When ENT is 256, ENT+CS is 264.\", \"line\": 33, \"span\": \"|  256  |  8 |   264  |  24  |\"}, {\"text\": \"When ENT is 256, MS is 24.\", \"line\": 33, \"span\": \"|  256  |  8 |   264  |  24  |\"}]}","ttft_ms":14776,"type":"result","duration_ms":14814,"uuid":"b905b4bf-8ce8-4d17-80a7-0c9c44b6dab7","ttft_stream_ms":1317,"time_to_request_ms":114,"first_content_frame_ms":1317,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
